## 4. Naming Conventions

| Layer                      | Convention                                      | Example                                                |
| -------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |
| Components (UI Kit / Apps) | PascalCase folder + `.jsx` file + `.module.css` | `Button/Button.jsx`, `Button.module.css`               |
| Component index file       | `index.js` or same name as folder               | `src/index.js` (barrel), `Button.jsx` inside `Button/` |
| Test files                 | `.test.jsx` next to the component               | `Button.test.jsx`                                      |
| CSS Modules                | `.module.css`                                   | `Button.module.css`                                    |
| Hooks                      | camelCase, prefixed with `use`                  | `useCases.js`, `useAuth()`                             |
| Context files              | PascalCase + `Context` suffix                   | `AuthContext.jsx`, `PermissionsContext.jsx`            |
| Services / utility         | camelCase or PascalCase class                   | `CasesService.js`, `HttpClient.js`, `baseLogs.js`      |
| Barrel exports             | `index.js` at package root or subfolder         | `src/index.js`, `auth/index.js`                        |
| Environment util           | `getEnvironmentVariable`                        | `utils/environmentVariables.js`                        |

